  "body": "Currently, it is impossible to block `about:blank` from loading. I expected the iframes to not load at all. I found this test (https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/master/content-security-policy/frame-src/frame-src-about-blank-allowed-by-default.sub.html) which suggests this is not a security issue, but I've found that this gives you a fresh copy of Window, which can give access to previously deleted objects (for example `RTCPeerConnection`, which can't be blocked with csp)",
